# Snake — 10x10 wrapping snake game: a SnakeGame class moves on a 120ms
# useFrameCallback tick, 4 simultaneous Fling gestures steer it, Skia draws the
# snake/food, a 3-digit rolling score counts food, a blur + "Life goes on..."
# button appear on game over (self collision only, walls wrap).
# What this test covers: steering in all four directions with flings on the
# board, a reverse fling (must be ignored by the 180-degree guard), long
# straight runs so the snake wraps through every edge, bursts of quick
# alternating flings (ping-pong swipes, retargeting direction many times per
# second), diagonal swipes (two fling recognizers firing together), and
# leaving the game running for a while (food/score updates if eaten).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/snake"
wait "text" "Score" 10000
wait 1500
gesture fling up 201 520 120
wait 900
gesture fling left 260 470 120
wait 900
gesture fling down 201 420 120
wait 900
gesture fling right 140 470 120
wait 900
# Reverse of the current direction: ignored.
gesture fling left 260 470 120
wait 1500
# Wrap through every edge.
gesture fling up 201 520 120
wait 1500
gesture fling left 260 470 120
wait 1500
gesture fling down 201 420 120
wait 1500
# Bursts of alternating flings.
swipe 150 470 260 470 --count 6 --pause-ms 50 --pattern ping-pong
wait 800
swipe 201 400 201 540 --count 6 --pause-ms 50 --pattern ping-pong
wait 800
# Diagonals.
swipe 150 550 260 420
wait 600
swipe 260 420 150 550
wait 600
swipe 260 550 150 420
wait 600
gesture fling right 140 470 120
wait 3000
gesture fling down 201 420 120
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
